    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deckadent challenges you to build a deck from the cards you collect in the world through quests or other discoveries</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cards:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 38 unique cards to choose from. Get creative! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Quests:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many NPCs offer quests, some silly and some serious, but all rewarding. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Monsters:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't let the cozy art style fool you; the world is full of monsters, each with unique attacks and behaviors. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Locations:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore four different worlds, each presenting its own challenges.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deckadent challenges you to build a deck from the cards you collect in the world through quests or other discoveries</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cards:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 38 unique cards to choose from. Get creative! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Quests:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many NPCs offer quests, some silly and some serious, but all rewarding. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Monsters:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't let the cozy art style fool you; the world is full of monsters, each with unique attacks and behaviors. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Locations:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore four different worlds, each presenting its own challenges.</p>",
    "short_description": "Deckadent is a top-down deck building RPG with several quests, bosses, enemies, and various locations to explore. You play as a hero, chosen by the God of the Cards to drive out the Deckay from the other fallen gods.",
